lt)\n}\n\npub(crate) fn plan_mask(model_catalog: &ModelCatalog) -> Option<CollaborationModeMask> {\n    mask_for_kind(model_catalog, ModeKind::Plan)\n}\n", "numLines": 63, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 63}}

